1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Have you ever wondered
why the sky is blue?

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:05,900
<i>Most people never ask.</i>

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,400
- Sunlight looks white,
- but it is a mix of colours.

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,000
Blue light is scattered
more than red light...

5
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:13,000
...by the tiny molecules in the air.

6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,000
That is why, at sunset,
the sky turns <b>orange</b> and red.

7
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,000
The light travels through more air.
